### Minister portraits for the Italosphere satellites.
###
### Four of the ministers Egypt and the Gulf seat had art on disk but no
### spriteType pointing at it, so the slot rendered blank. The rest of the
### EGY / GUL / IEA / IME roster still has no art in either branch.

